[root] Build the voxel showcase control and fire slice (complete)
Files: voxel-showcase.vine; proposals/voxel-showcase.md; crates/voxel-sample/**
Do: Implement the first two sample tools through the complete architecture: journal-described tool selection and icons for removal, then a deterministic matrix-driven fire object with Tau animation. Preserve immutable worldline authority, direct logical-time queries, and target-neutral frame output. Keep wave function collapse as a measured follow-up rather than a hidden source of randomness.
Accept: The proposal's control paths are implemented and evidenced; tool selection is a VoxelFact folded into VoxelState; Remove and Fire publish distinct immutable facts; redraw has no out-of-band tool input; matrix fire behavior is deterministic at LogicalTime; fire animation varies only with Tau; palette output is deterministic; and the workspace tests pass.
